$ORIGIN funforboth.com.
$TTL 3600

; Only redirects to https://booksforboth.com (Cloudflare → Rules → Redirect Rules).
; Import with „Proxy imported DNS records“ ON: a redirect rule only sees proxied traffic.
; 192.0.2.1 and 100:: lead nowhere on purpose – Cloudflare answers before they are reached.
funforboth.com.      3600  IN  A     192.0.2.1
funforboth.com.      3600  IN  AAAA  100::
www.funforboth.com.  3600  IN  A     192.0.2.1
www.funforboth.com.  3600  IN  AAAA  100::
